   "en": "Open in real life. Closed on Google Maps. 📍\n\n1️⃣ No hours, no photos, no menu\n✅ Fix: a complete profile that links to your own website\n\n2️⃣ The website button opens a broken page\n✅ Fix: a fast site with the same hours and menu\n\n3️⃣ Reviews sit there unanswered\n✅ Fix: review alerts on WhatsApp, reply the same day\n\nSaffron Street Cafe is a concept demo. Send this to a shop owner who needs it.\nComment MAPS 👇\n\nVoiceover is AI-generated (ElevenLabs).",
   "hi": "Dukaan asli mein khuli, Google Maps par band. 📍\n\n1️⃣ Na timing, na photos, na menu\n✅ Fix: poora profile, link aapki website par\n\n2️⃣ Website button toota page kholta hai\n✅ Fix: tez site, same timing aur menu\n\n3️⃣ Reviews ka jawab nahi\n✅ Fix: WhatsApp par review alert, usi din reply\n\nSaffron Street Cafe ek concept demo hai. Kisi shop owner ko bhejiye.\nComment MAPS.\n\nVoiceover is AI-generated (ElevenLabs)."
